</div></p>
<p><strong>BUUCTF: <a href="https://buuoj.cn/challenges"target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://buuoj.cn/challenges</a></strong></p>
<hr>
<p>相关阅读
<a href="https://ctf-wiki.org/"target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CTF Wiki</a>
<a href="https://blog.csdn.net/qq_39150356/article/details/135980077"target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">HashCat 恢复Excel、Word、PPT密码保姆教程</a>
<a href="https://blog.csdn.net/c868954104/article/details/134599989"target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">buuctf MISC - hashcat</a></p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185910079.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185910079.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<h3 id="题目描述">题目描述：</h3>
<p>得到的 flag 请包上 flag{} 提交。</p>
<h3 id="密文">密文：</h3>
<p>下载附件，解压得到What kind of document is this_文件。</p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185911867.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185911867.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<hr>
<h3 id="解题思路">解题思路：</h3>
<p>1、文件名提示，需要确定文件类型。在010 Editor中打开，根据文件头 <code>D0 CF 11 E0</code> 确定是MS Office文件。</p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">MS</span> <span class="n">Office文件</span>      <span class="n">文件头</span><span class="err">：</span><span class="n">D0</span> <span class="n">CF</span> <span class="mi">11</span> <span class="n">E0</span>
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185912963.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185912963.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>但是MS Office文件包括MS Word/Excel/PPT三种文件，随便尝试一种文件，发现有密码。</p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185914958.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185914958.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>2、结合题目 <code>hashcat</code> ，我们使用HashCat恢复MS Office文件（Excel、Word、PPT）密码。</p>
<p>首先，使用office2john.py获取文件的hash值。</p>
<p>office2john.py文件下载地址： <a href="https://github.com/magnumripper/JohnTheRipper/blob/bleeding-jumbo/run/office2john.py"target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://github.com/magnumripper/JohnTheRipper/blob/bleeding-jumbo/run/office2john.py</a></p>
<p>CMD中打开，命令如下：</p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">python</span> <span class="n">office2john</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">py</span> <span class="s2">&#34;What kind of document is this_&#34;</span> <span class="o">&gt;</span> <span class="nb">hash</span>
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185916686.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185916686.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>得到文件的hash值如下：</p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185917937.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185917937.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>去掉文件名 <code>What kind of document is this_:</code> ，保留 <code>$office$</code> 及之后的数据。（从 <code>$office$*2010*</code> 可以得到该文件使用的是 <strong>Office2010</strong> 版本，后面要用到！）</p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="err">$</span><span class="n">office</span><span class="err">$</span><span class="o">*</span><span class="mi">2010</span><span class="o">*</span><span class="mi">100000</span><span class="o">*</span><span class="mi">128</span><span class="o">*</span><span class="mi">16</span><span class="o">*</span><span class="mi">265</span><span class="n">c4784621f00ddb85cc3a7227dade7</span><span class="o">*</span><span class="n">f0cc4179b2fcc2a2c5fa417566806249</span><span class="o">*</span><span class="n">b5ad5b66c0b84ba6e5d01f27ad8cffbdb409a4eddc4a87cd4dfbc46ad60160c9</span>
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185919283.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185919283.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>最后，使用HashCat根据hash值去解析密码。</p>
<p>HashCat官方网站： <a href="https://hashcat.net/hashcat/"target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://hashcat.net/hashcat/</a></p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185920623.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185920623.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>将hash文件放到hashcat文件夹下，CMD打开，命令如下：</p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">hashcat</span> <span class="o">-</span><span class="n">m</span> <span class="mi">9500</span> <span class="nb">hash</span> <span class="o">-</span><span class="n">a</span> <span class="mi">3</span> <span class="err">?</span><span class="n">d</span><span class="err">?</span><span class="n">d</span><span class="err">?</span><span class="n">d</span><span class="err">?</span><span class="n">d</span> <span class="o">-</span><span class="n">w</span> <span class="mi">3</span> <span class="o">-</span><span class="n">O</span>
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><blockquote>
<p>破解 Office 加密 Offcie 版本对应哈希类型
Office97-03(MD5+RC4,oldoffice$0,oldoffice$1)：-m 9700
Office97-03($0/$1, MD5 + RC4, collider #1)：-m 9710
Office97-03($0/$1, MD5 + RC4, collider #2)：-m 9720
Office97-03($3/$4, SHA1 + RC4)：-m 9800
Office97-03($3, SHA1 + RC4, collider #1)：-m9810
Office97-03($3, SHA1 + RC4, collider #2)：-m9820
Office2007：-m 9400
<strong>Office2010：-m 9500</strong>
Office2013：-m 9600</p>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
<p>Hashcat 中自定义破解含义值：
?l = abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz，代表小写字母。
?u = ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ，代表大写字母。
?d = 0123456789，代表数字。
?s = !&quot;#$%&amp;&rsquo;()*+,-./:;&lt;=&gt;?@[]^_`{|}~，代表特殊字符。
?a = ?l?u?d?s，大小写数字及特殊字符的组合。
?b = 0x00 - 0xff</p>
</blockquote>
<p>出现下图所示内容，表示成功运行。

<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185922895.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185922895.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>在上条命令的后面加上 <code>--show</code> 参数，显示密码为 <code>9919</code> 。</p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">hashcat</span> <span class="o">-</span><span class="n">m</span> <span class="mi">9500</span> <span class="nb">hash</span> <span class="o">-</span><span class="n">a</span> <span class="mi">3</span> <span class="err">?</span><span class="n">d</span><span class="err">?</span><span class="n">d</span><span class="err">?</span><span class="n">d</span><span class="err">?</span><span class="n">d</span> <span class="o">-</span><span class="n">w</span> <span class="mi">3</span> <span class="o">-</span><span class="n">O</span> <span class="o">--</span><span class="n">show</span>
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185925153.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185925153.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>3、使用密码尝试Excel、Word、PPT文件，直到后缀为 <code>.ppt</code> 的PPT文件，才正常显示内容。</p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185926521.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185926521.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185927923.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185927923.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185928981.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185928981.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>存在7张空白的幻灯片，全选之后，到“设计”选项卡，选择“设置背景格式”，选择黑色纯色填充。</p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185931258.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185931258.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>在第七张幻灯片中，得到flag。</p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185933091.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228185933091.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<h3 id="flag">flag：</h3>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">flag<span class="o">{</span>okYOUWIN<span class="o">}</span>
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><h3 id="hashcat常用实例">HashCat常用实例</h3>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt"> 1
</span><span class="lnt"> 2
</span><span class="lnt"> 3
</span><span class="lnt"> 4
</span><span class="lnt"> 5
</span><span class="lnt"> 6
</span><span class="lnt"> 7
</span><span class="lnt"> 8
</span><span class="lnt"> 9
</span><span class="lnt">10
</span><span class="lnt">11
</span><span class="lnt">12
</span><span class="lnt">13
</span><span class="lnt">14
</span><span class="lnt">15
</span><span class="lnt">16
</span><span class="lnt">17
</span><span class="lnt">18
</span><span class="lnt">19
</span><span class="lnt">20
</span><span class="lnt">21
</span><span class="lnt">22
</span><span class="lnt">23
</span><span class="lnt">24
</span><span class="lnt">25
</span><span class="lnt">26
</span><span class="lnt">27
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="mi">8</span> <span class="n">位数字破解</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">Hashcat64</span> <span class="o">-</span><span class="n">m</span> <span class="mi">9700</span> <span class="nb">hash</span> <span class="o">-</span><span class="n">a</span> <span class="mi">3</span> <span class="err">?</span><span class="n">d</span><span class="err">?</span><span class="n">d</span><span class="err">?</span><span class="n">d</span><span class="err">?</span><span class="n">d</span><span class="err">?</span><span class="n">d</span><span class="err">?</span><span class="n">d</span><span class="err">?</span><span class="n">d</span><span class="err">?</span><span class="n">d</span> <span class="o">-</span><span class="n">w</span> <span class="mi">3</span> <span class="err">–</span><span class="n">O</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
